<title>DUBAI: Iran says arrests U.S. national for illegal entry.</title>
<headline>Iran says arrests U.S. national for illegal entry.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of Iran's judiciary Ayatollah Mohammad Yazdi said on Tuesday Iran had recently arrested a U.S. national for entering the country illegally, Iranian radio reported.</p>
<p>&quot;An American has...been recently detained because of illegal entry,&quot; the radio, monitored by the British Broadcasting Corporation, quoted Yazdi as telling a news conference.</p>
<p>The radio gave no further details.</p>
<p>Iran and the United States have no diplomatic relations.</p>
</text>
